# React / React Native (detect-on — မတွေ့ရင် Skip)

- Flutter = `09-flutter-standards.mdc`
- SPFx = `04-sharepoint-standards.mdc` (React web Skip)

## Detect Priority (ရှာဖွေမှု အစဉ်)

- `react-native` → **RN** သာ
- `react` && !`react-native` && !SPFx → **React (web)** သာ
- **မရောရ**

---

## React (web)

**Surface:** `frontend` / `fullstack`

- Semantic HTML + repo UI patterns — စိတ်ကူးယဉ် styling lib မထည့်
- Components/hooks = repo ဖွဲ့စည်းပုံ; business logic UI မရော
- Routing/data = ရှိပြီးသား stack (Next / React Router / TanStack Query) — မရှိရင် Clarify-first
- Lists/forms = key, controlled inputs, loading/error/empty states
- SEO/A11y web အသက်ဝင်
- `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` မသုံး (sanitize မပါဘဲ)

---

## React Native

**Surface:** `mobile`

- DOM/web CSS **မသုံး** — RN primitives (`View` / `Text` / `Pressable` / `FlatList`)
- Navigation = repo pattern (React Navigation) — စိတ်ကူးယဉ် lib မထည့်
- Platform/permissions/SecureStore·Keychain ကွာခြားချက် ထည့်တွက်
- Lists = `FlatList` / `SectionList` (ရှည် list တွင် `.map`+`ScrollView` ရှောင်)
- A11y = `accessibilityLabel` / `accessibilityRole` / touch target
- web `aria-*` / SEO HTML **မသုံး**
